<witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T02:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Continued working tension up/down to release tubing bonnet. Managed to level out the travel evenly around bonnet. Slacked off tension and lowered soft slings to XMT-deck to remove braided wire slings and connect soft slings directly to ball valve. Dropped 1ea 2m 2 1/2&quot; braided wire sling into tubing while disassembling. Evaluated situation and covered tubing.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T02:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T05:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Connected soft slings to pad eyes on ball valve. Continued attempting to release tubing bonnet, working tension up/down while hammering on bonnet. Slowly making progress.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T05:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T06:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Tubing bonnet came loose. Removed latch ring releasing bolts. Pulled tubing bonnet, spacer spool and ball valve to drill floor. Covered tubing hanger with bucket.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T06:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T07:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Cleaned wellhead for landing surface riser. Meanwhile prepared surface riser for lifting.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T07:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T07:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed TBT for installing riser. P/U surface riser and tailed same into well centre. Lowered surface riser through rotary and latched on to surface wellhead. Production Dept informed re-start production from adjacent wells according to SimOps-procedure.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T07:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T08:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed TBT for installing diverter. P/U and nippled up diverter.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T08:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T09:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- bop/wellhead equipment</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml