 Meanwhile performed TBT for L/D tubing hanger.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T11:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T12:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">799</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- bop/wellhead equipment</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Removed master bushings. Pulled tubing hanger free with nop overpull. Pulled tubing hanger above rotary.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T12:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T13:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">799</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- bop/wellhead equipment</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Cut and terminated ESP cable, tested same. Meanwhile R/U compact auto slips and B/O tubing hanger.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T13:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T13:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">799</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- bop/wellhead equipment</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>L/D down tubing hanger and running tool, assisted by crane.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T13:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T14:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">763</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- completion string</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH with 7 5/8&quot; tubing with ESP cable from 799 m to 763m. Observed approx 30 cm of damaged armor cable.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T14:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-05T15:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">763</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Inspected cable. Lowered banana sheave from derrick to rig floor to allow damaged piece to pass through. Recovered parts of armor on next clamp on tubing. Approx 15 cm armor missing, presumably left in well.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2015-02-05T15:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2015-02-06T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">141</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- completion string</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH with 7 5/8&quot; tubing with ESP cable from 763 m to 141 m. Avg pulling speed 5,8 joints/hr</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
